{{> page-header eyebrow="Animalife Affiliate Rewards Program" heading="Partner with Purpose. Rewarding Results." subheading="Join a trusted network of equine professionals and earn generous rewards while making a real difference in horses' lives."}}

<section class="section">
  <p class="max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">Animalife is not another supplement company. For more than 21 years, Animalife has developed innovative equine health and wellness solutions designed to help horses perform at their highest level, recover more effectively, remain sound longer, and enjoy healthier, more productive lives.</p>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-al-ink/75">As Animalife expands throughout North America, we are inviting a select group of equine professionals to become Affiliate Partners and participate in one of the most rewarding commission programs in the industry.</p>

  <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {{#each affiliateAudiences}}
    <div class="card p-5">
      <p class="font-display text-base font-medium text-al-navy">{{this.title}}</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-al-ink/65">{{this.body}}</p>
    </div>
    {{/each}}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-al-cream-dark/60">
  <div class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Because Results Matter</div>
    <h2 class="font-display mt-4 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-medium text-al-navy sm:text-4xl">What makes Animalife different?</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-sm text-al-ink/70">The equine supplement industry is crowded with products that promise everything and deliver very little. Animalife takes a different approach&mdash;our products are designed to support the body's natural biological processes, helping horses perform, recover, and stay healthier for longer.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {{#each (array "Science-Based Formulations" "Pharmaceutical-Grade Ingredients" "Root Cause Approach vs. Temporary Fixes" "Safe for Long-Term Use" "Trusted by Trainers, Riders, and Horse Owners" "Designed for Performance, Recovery, and Longevity")}}
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-al-ink/80">{{{icon "check" "w-4 h-4 text-al-orange shrink-0"}}}{{this}}</div>
      {{/each}}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="eyebrow">Products That Stand Apart</div>
  <h2 class="font-display mt-4 text-3xl font-medium text-al-navy sm:text-4xl">Three systems worth representing.</h2>
  <div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="card p-6">
      <p class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">VetroFlex™</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-orange">Joint, Cartilage &amp; Connective Tissue Restoration</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-al-ink/70">
        <li>&bull; Cartilage Health</li><li>&bull; Tendons &amp; Ligaments</li><li>&bull; Joint Comfort</li><li>&bull; Long-Term Soundness</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card p-6">
      <p class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">VetroFen™</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-orange">Advanced Inflammation &amp; Pain Management</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-al-ink/70">
        <li>&bull; Healthy Inflammatory Response</li><li>&bull; Comfort &amp; Mobility</li><li>&bull; Recovery Following Exercise</li><li>&bull; Performance Longevity</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card p-6">
      <p class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">VetroFit™</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-orange">Oxygen Transport &amp; Recovery</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-al-ink/70">
        <li>&bull; Oxygen Delivery</li><li>&bull; Cardiovascular Efficiency</li><li>&bull; Electrolyte Balance</li><li>&bull; Competitive Performance</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-al-navy text-white">
  <div class="section text-center">
    <div class="eyebrow !text-al-orange-light mx-auto justify-center">The Highest Paying Affiliate Program in the Industry</div>
    <h2 class="font-display mt-4 text-3xl font-medium sm:text-4xl">We Believe Partners Should Be Rewarded Like Partners.</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-white/70">Most equine affiliate programs offer commissions in the 5%&ndash;15% range.</p>
    <p class="font-display mt-3 text-5xl font-semibold text-al-orange-light">Animalife pays up to 40%</p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 text-left sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/15 p-6">
        <p class="font-display text-base font-medium">Direct Referral Commissions</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">Earn commissions every time a customer purchases through your referral link.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/15 p-6">
        <p class="font-display text-base font-medium">Recurring Customer Revenue</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">As customers continue purchasing products, your commissions continue to grow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/15 p-6">
        <p class="font-display text-base font-medium">Complimentary Products</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">Receive products for personal use, demonstrations, client education, and promotional activities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/15 p-6">
        <p class="font-display text-base font-medium">Exclusive Promotions</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">Access special affiliate-only campaigns and incentives throughout the year.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="eyebrow">We Invest in Your Success</div>
  <h2 class="font-display mt-4 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-medium text-al-navy sm:text-4xl">Most companies hand you a link. We hand you a business.</h2>
  <div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="card p-6">
      <div class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-al-navy/5 text-al-navy">{{{icon "mic" "w-5 h-5"}}}</div>
      <p class="font-display mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">Professional Training</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-al-ink/70">Product science, customer conversations, sales strategies, positioning techniques, industry best practices.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card p-6">
      <div class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-al-navy/5 text-al-navy">{{{icon "file-text" "w-5 h-5"}}}</div>
      <p class="font-display mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">Marketing Support</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-al-ink/70">Professional brochures, product sheets, videos, podcasts, white papers, social media &amp; advertising materials.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card p-6">
      <div class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-al-navy/5 text-al-navy">{{{icon "bolt" "w-5 h-5"}}}</div>
      <p class="font-display mt-4 text-lg font-medium text-al-navy">Affiliate Dashboard</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-al-ink/70">Track referrals, orders, commissions, bonuses, and performance metrics in real time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-al-cream-dark/60" id="calculator">
  <div class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Affiliate Earnings Calculator</div>
    <h2 class="font-display mt-4 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-medium text-al-navy sm:text-4xl">See what your network could be worth.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm text-al-ink/70">Adjust the sliders below&mdash;the calculator updates instantly.</p>

    <div data-affiliate-calculator class="mt-10 grid gap-10 rounded-2xl border border-al-line bg-white p-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="space-y-7">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-sm font-semibold text-al-navy"><span>How many horses do you influence?</span><span data-calc-horses-val>250</span></div>
          <input data-calc-horses type="range" min="10" max="1000" step="10" value="250" class="mt-3 w-full accent-al-orange" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="field-label">Average annual supplement spend (per horse)</label>
          <input data-calc-spend type="number" value="2500" min="0" step="50" class="input-field" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-sm font-semibold text-al-navy"><span>Expected conversion</span><span data-calc-conversion-val>15%</span></div>
          <input data-calc-conversion type="range" min="1" max="100" step="1" value="15" class="mt-3 w-full accent-al-orange" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-sm font-semibold text-al-navy"><span>Average commission</span><span data-calc-commission-val>30%</span></div>
          <input data-calc-commission type="range" min="5" max="40" step="1" value="30" class="mt-3 w-full accent-al-orange" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-al-navy p-10 text-center text-white">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-al-orange-light">Estimated Annual Earnings</p>
        <p data-calc-output class="font-display mt-4 text-5xl font-semibold">$28,125</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-white/60">Illustrative estimate only. Actual results vary by referral activity and commission tier.</p>
        <a href="/professionals/apply" class="btn-primary mt-8">Become an Affiliate</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="eyebrow">Who Should Apply?</div>
  <h2 class="font-display mt-4 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-medium text-al-navy sm:text-4xl">Built for equine professionals.</h2>
  <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {{#each affiliateAudiences}}
    <div class="card p-6">
      <p class="font-display text-base font-medium text-al-navy">{{this.title}}</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-al-ink/65">{{this.body}}</p>
    </div>
    {{/each}}
    <div class="card p-6">
      <p class="font-display text-base font-medium text-al-navy">Tack Stores &amp; Retailers</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-al-ink/65">Add a profitable new revenue source while offering differentiated products.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-al-navy py-20 text-center text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6">
    <p class="font-display text-3xl font-medium sm:text-4xl">Ready to Feel the Difference?</p>
    <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-white/70">Join a growing network of equine professionals who are helping horses perform better, recover faster, and enjoy longer, healthier careers.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="/professionals/apply" class="btn-primary">Apply Now</a>
      <a href="mailto:partnerships@animalifeusa.com" class="btn-outline-light">Schedule a Discovery Call</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
